<title>USA: CCC buys 80,000 T US white wheat for Bangladesh.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 80,000 T US white wheat for Bangladesh.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said on Thursday it had purchased 80,000 tonnes of U.S. soft white wheat for export to Bangladesh, December 1-25 shipment.</p>
<p>Continental Grain sold 17,250 tonnes at $154.49 per tonne, FOB Kalama, WA, 17,250 tonnes at $155.19, FOB Vancover, WA and 13,000 tonnes at $158.34, FOB Tacoma, WA.</p>
<p>Cargill sold 23,000 tonnes at $154.46 and 9,500 tonnes at $155.93, FOB Portland, OR.</p>
<p>--Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
